# Club & Grub level file - format 1 (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md 7, docs/LEVEL_DESIGN.md).
# World 3-1 'Frost Summit', second half: the blizzard pass (linked sub-stage of w3_l1). Owner: level designer w3.
# A head wind blows in gusts (meta wind: lulls of wind 12, gusts that swell to 56 on Beginner and 72 on Expert, the
# snow thickens before each one). A gust shortens every jump to almost nothing and pushes a standing hero back
# across the ice; crouching is immune. So: brace (crouch) in the gusts, jump in the lulls. Rock (set B) grips, the
# snow on ice (set A) does not. Sections: the summit cave exit, an ice slope, the crevasse of rock pillars, the
# frozen pond with ice floes, the climb to the shelter ridge with a charger, the ice bridge, the hut at the exit.
# Secrets: the ice grotto under the pond (break the blocks at the shore) and the eagle ledge above the crevasse.

